        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagi'li'zyo lya ku'wu'ka ku' Sinai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Wu'ka henanha, ev'e haki'mo na v'antu' av'o wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, muye ku' nsi' i'yo nav'alagana Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, aho ndi' nayomba, ‘Ndav'ape v'av'yalwa v'inywe nsi' yeni'yi'.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ene ndamutu'me malaika amutongelele, nanne ndav'asage V'akanaani, V'aamoli, V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagi ku' nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki'. Ali'vi ku'nguno inywe muli' na myoyo milambu, nkasye nje haki'mo na inywe, ku'du' nize muzimangu'zye mu nzi'la.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' aho v'igagwa mmola yeni'yo mbi, v'ali'laga muno, hangi' ku'du'hu' muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo wazwalaga wu'lembo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wasangwa wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “V'awi'le V'aizilaeli, ‘Inywe muli' v'antu' v'a myoyo milambu. U'lu' nje haki'mo na inywe ku' itungo ido du', nku'muzimangu'zya. Ku'nguno yeni'yo muzule wu'lembo winywe ki'gele manye lya ku'muv'ezezya.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, V'aizilaeli v'awu'zulaga wu'lembo wav'o, henanho ha lu'gu'lu' lwa Holebu na v'akazwalile hangi' ninga ku' mbele ya musi'nzo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wav'age na ki'ti'le cha ku'li'ki'ndi'ka ihema katanalo na nkambi'. Ihema lyeni'lo wali'paga lina, Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Yav'age muntu' u'yo wakoov'age wu'yangu' ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, wayage ku' Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, i'lo lyav'age katanalo na nkambi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose aho wav'age ali'fuma ku'ya ku' ihema lyeni'lo, v'antu' v'ose v'i'i'mage ha mizigo zya mahema gav'o, na ku'mulola Mose mpaka aho ali'wingi'la mugati' na ihema lyeni'lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha itungo i'lo Mose ali'wingi'la mu ihema lyeni'lo, i'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' lyasookage ha muzigo gwa ihema, haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombage na Mose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' v'ose aho v'av'age mbe v'ali'wona i'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ya ha muzigo gwa ihema, ki'la yu'mo waku'v'i'i'lage ha muzigo gwa ihema lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I'vi hu' vyene Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombage na Mose ki'ti' minso ku' minso, yaani ki'ti' muntu' na munwaniye. Hangi' Mose wasu'v'age ku' nkambi', ali'vi musu'mbana Yoswa, mwana wamwa Nuni, u'yo wav'age mugwasya wakwe, ndi' akamufumaga mu ihema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mose ali'lomba ku'wona lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wamuwi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu ati', “Lingaga! Ev'e u'li'mbwi'la, ‘V'alondole v'antu' v'enav'a,’ ali'vi u'kampile mmola ati', nde u'lamutu'me av'e haki'mo nanne. Ninga i'vyo wayombile ati', ‘Nku'manyile lina lyako, nanho wapandi'kile wu'soga ha mbele yanne.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' nu'kwikonga, u'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, u'ndagi'le nzi'la zyako, ki'gele mpandi'ke ku'ku'manya na kwendeleya ku'pandi'ka wu'soga ha mbele yako. Hangi' wizu'ki'le ku'v'a nsi' yeni'yi' v'ali' v'antu' v'ako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene mweni'ki'li' nku'ya haki'mo nanho, na ku'ku'lembezya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wayombaga ati', “U'lu' u'kav'ile ku'ya haki'mo niswe, hohene, ku'du' u'ku'sinie henanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yi'ku'manyi'ka vihe ku'v'a napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, ene haki'mo na v'antu' v'ako? Sumbwa du' ku'nguno ya ev'e ku'ya haki'mo na iswe yi'ku'manyi'ka ku'v'a ene haki'mo na v'antu' v'ako ku'li' v'a heke mugati' na v'antu' v'ose mu welelo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Nku'ku'v'ezezya igambo lyeni'li' i'lo walombaga, ku'nguno wapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yanne, nanne nku'manyile lina lyako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wayombaga, “Nu'kwikonga u'ndagi'le lu'kumo lwako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'v'i'tya wu'soga wanne wose ha mbele yako, nanne nku'li'kumalu'sya lina lyanne, ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ Ene ndamuwonele ki'sa u'yo ntogilwe ku'muwonela ki'sa, na ku'musayi'la u'yo ntogilwe ku'musayi'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'kasye u'kowole ku'mbona wu'syu' wanne, ku'nguno ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo akowolile ku'mbona nawe av'e muzuwu'ku.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, ku'li' na lwandi' lwa bi'hi' nanne u'lo ukwi'ma ha igu'lya na itale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'kumo lwanne aho lu'ku'v'a lu'li'v'i'ta, nku'ku'tu'u'la mu mpembo ha itale na nku'ku'kumbi'la na mukono gwanne, mpaka aho nku'v'a nav'i'ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' nku'gu'sinia mukono gwanne nanho u'ku'mbona ku' nnuma, ali'vi wu'syu' wanne u'ku'leka ku'wu'wona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.33.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
